# Case Automation Inventory & Migration Assessment
## TS-9 Batch 0 Analysis

**Generated:** 2025  
**Scope:** Full Case object automation audit for Record-Triggered Flow migration  
**Status:** Pre-migration dependency & conflict assessment

---

## Executive Summary

This document inventories all Case-related automation, custom fields, and managed-package integrations to assess readiness for migrating escalation logic to a Salesforce Record-Triggered Flow (scheduled path). The analysis identifies:

- **Active Automation:** CaseTriggerHandler (inline trigger logic), Case assignment rules (org-pending verification)
- **Managed-Package Integrations:** slackv2 namespace (Visualforce page + trigger), LeanData namespace (continuous clean trigger)
- **Custom Fields:** 11 custom/standard Case fields with escalation relevance
- **Risk Level:** LOW → MEDIUM (pending org confirmation of active assignment/auto-response rules and managed-package trigger behavior)

